WEBVTT

1
00:00:28.541 --> 00:00:31.000
In Chapter 12, Lord Krishna

2
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:34.583
has so far described several levels of devotion.

3
00:00:34.583 --> 00:00:35.500
In verse 12.8,

4
00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:38.583
He described the highest form of devotion –

5
00:00:38.583 --> 00:00:41.458
fixing both mind and intellect

6
00:00:41.458 --> 00:00:44.458
in Lord Krishna.

7
00:00:44.458 --> 00:00:48.125
But Lord Krishna is compassionate.

8
00:00:48.125 --> 00:00:50.125
He knows that not everyone

9
00:00:50.125 --> 00:00:52.500
can reach this level immediately.

10
00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:55.125
That is why He kept making
the levels of devotion

11
00:00:55.125 --> 00:00:57.291
gradually more accessible,

12
00:00:57.291 --> 00:01:00.208
so that every person can progress on this path,

13
00:01:00.208 --> 00:01:03.041
according to their own situation.

14
00:01:03.041 --> 00:01:03.916
In verse 12.9,

15
00:01:03.916 --> 00:01:07.166
He mentioned abhyasa yoga,

16
00:01:07.166 --> 00:01:10.916
where being involved in devotion's small acts

17
00:01:10.916 --> 00:01:13.541
advances us toward devotion.

18
00:01:13.541 --> 00:01:15.000
Then in verse 12.10,

19
00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:17.875
He encouraged dedicating actions

20
00:01:17.875 --> 00:01:21.500
to Lord Krishna.

21
00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:22.375
And now,

22
00:01:22.375 --> 00:01:25.083
when He knows that for some people

23
00:01:25.083 --> 00:01:27.166
this too may be difficult,

24
00:01:27.166 --> 00:01:30.166
He presents yet another level,

25
00:01:30.166 --> 00:01:30.833
where a person

26
00:01:30.833 --> 00:01:34.916
can become steady and
content within themselves

27
00:01:34.916 --> 00:01:38.500
simply by giving up attachment
to the fruits of their actions.

28
00:01:38.500 --> 00:01:41.958
This too leads toward devotion.

29
00:01:46.666 --> 00:01:48.208
Lord Krishna says –

30
00:01:48.208 --> 00:01:51.750
‘If you cannot act with surrender to Me,

31
00:01:51.750 --> 00:01:54.583
then give up attachment to the results

32
00:01:54.583 --> 00:01:58.166
of all your actions

33
00:01:58.166 --> 00:02:00.750
and become steady within yourself.’

34
00:02:00.750 --> 00:02:03.208
This message is for those

35
00:02:03.208 --> 00:02:04.708
who are unable to directly

36
00:02:04.708 --> 00:02:08.666
dedicate their actions to Lord Krishna.

37
00:02:08.666 --> 00:02:12.375
Giving up attachment to the fruits of action

38
00:02:12.375 --> 00:02:13.958
is not the purest form of devotion,

39
00:02:13.958 --> 00:02:16.250
but it purifies the mind

40
00:02:16.250 --> 00:02:20.875
and prepares a person for higher devotion.

41
00:02:20.875 --> 00:02:22.916
Karma-phala-tyaga means –

42
00:02:22.916 --> 00:02:25.958
performing one's duties with a selfless spirit,

43
00:02:25.958 --> 00:02:28.333
without any personal motive.

44
00:02:28.333 --> 00:02:31.000
When a person gives up
selfishness and attachment,

45
00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:33.833
they begin to become pure within, and this

46
00:02:33.833 --> 00:02:34.916
starts to reveal

47
00:02:34.916 --> 00:02:38.791
higher truths of the world within them.

48
00:02:38.791 --> 00:02:42.625
Lord Krishna's compassion
is clearly visible here.

49
00:02:42.625 --> 00:02:45.208
He accepts even those

50
00:02:45.208 --> 00:02:48.916
who are not progressing in devotion at all.

51
00:02:48.916 --> 00:02:49.916
He suggests for them

52
00:02:49.916 --> 00:02:51.416
this path of selfless service

53
00:02:51.416 --> 00:02:54.083
and action.

54
00:02:54.083 --> 00:02:57.458
Selfless service can take many forms –

55
00:02:57.458 --> 00:03:01.041
charity, social service,

56
00:03:01.041 --> 00:03:04.708
or awakening the feeling in one's regular work

57
00:03:04.708 --> 00:03:08.000
that it is being done for the good of society.

58
00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:11.000
All of these purify the mind.

59
00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:13.166
And gradually such a person

60
00:03:13.166 --> 00:03:15.958
also comes to understand that ultimately

61
00:03:15.958 --> 00:03:18.458
the beneficiary of this selfless service

62
00:03:18.458 --> 00:03:21.458
is Lord Krishna Himself, because the world

63
00:03:21.458 --> 00:03:23.000
and the people in it,

64
00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:25.500
are themselves parts of Him.

65
00:03:25.500 --> 00:03:28.000
An important word in this verse is

66
00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:31.750
yatatmavan – meaning one who
is steady within themselves.

67
00:03:31.750 --> 00:03:35.750
When a person acts without attachment,

68
00:03:35.750 --> 00:03:36.500
their mind

69
00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:39.333
begins to be freed from external desires,

70
00:03:39.333 --> 00:03:42.833
and inner stability develops within them.

71
00:03:42.833 --> 00:03:45.125
This stability prepares them to advance

72
00:03:45.125 --> 00:03:47.833
on the path of devotion.

73
00:03:47.833 --> 00:03:50.416
The essence of this verse is this – that no

74
00:03:50.416 --> 00:03:53.375
sincere effort goes to waste.

75
00:03:53.375 --> 00:03:56.375
Even if one cannot be absorbed in devotion,

76
00:03:56.375 --> 00:03:59.625
but through selfless service and action,

77
00:03:59.625 --> 00:04:02.625
progress of the soul is possible.

78
00:04:02.625 --> 00:04:06.833
Lord Krishna does not expect here that everyone

79
00:04:06.833 --> 00:04:08.791
remain absorbed in His devotion alone,

80
00:04:08.791 --> 00:04:11.208
or dedicate their actions to Him.

81
00:04:11.208 --> 00:04:14.833
He is suggesting a path of spiritual progress

82
00:04:14.833 --> 00:04:18.458
to every person according to
their faith and level.

83
00:04:18.458 --> 00:04:23.375
And this itself is the proof
of His compassion and love.

84
00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:30.416
I do not expect anyone

85
00:04:30.416 --> 00:04:34.708
to be perfect in devotion.

86
00:04:34.708 --> 00:04:38.750
I know that everyone's life is different,

87
00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:42.416
and everyone's circumstances too.

88
00:04:42.416 --> 00:04:43.958
That is why

89
00:04:43.958 --> 00:04:47.416
I have described different levels,

90
00:04:47.416 --> 00:04:49.916
so that a person, wherever they are,

91
00:04:49.916 --> 00:04:52.166
can move forward from there.

92
00:04:52.166 --> 00:04:54.250
Now think –

93
00:04:54.250 --> 00:04:59.125
can you adopt this perspective in your own life?

94
00:04:59.125 --> 00:05:03.708
Do you accept someone even

95
00:05:03.708 --> 00:05:07.291
when they completely

96
00:05:07.291 --> 00:05:09.833
disagree with your views?

97
00:05:09.833 --> 00:05:11.666
Do you respect their

98
00:05:11.666 --> 00:05:14.750
path even,

99
00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:18.291
when it is different from yours?

100
00:05:18.291 --> 00:05:20.875
Can you give your suggestion

101
00:05:20.875 --> 00:05:23.125
with love?

102
00:05:23.125 --> 00:05:27.000
Without the expectation that they will follow

103
00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:30.916
your given suggestion.

104
00:05:30.916 --> 00:05:32.083
And if

105
00:05:32.083 --> 00:05:35.250
they ever need help,

106
00:05:35.250 --> 00:05:39.708
will you be available with an open mind?

107
00:05:39.708 --> 00:05:42.291
Think about this.

108
00:05:42.291 --> 00:05:48.458
If love is based only on agreement

109
00:05:48.458 --> 00:05:52.000
then it is not love.

110
00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:53.750
True love

111
00:05:53.750 --> 00:05:56.333
and true generosity

112
00:05:56.333 --> 00:05:59.333
set people free.

113
00:05:59.333 --> 00:06:03.750
They do not bind with the chains of expectation.

114
00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:07.708
Keep giving your suggestions to others.

115
00:06:07.708 --> 00:06:12.875
But free yourself from your expectations.

116
00:06:12.875 --> 00:06:17.291
Help others, but then

117
00:06:17.291 --> 00:06:22.000
let them walk their own path too.

118
00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:24.416
In this lies peace,

119
00:06:24.416 --> 00:06:26.666
and in this lies

120
00:06:26.666 --> 00:06:29.375
true sensitivity.

121
00:06:34.291 --> 00:06:38.375
Do you expect every member of your family

122
00:06:38.375 --> 00:06:41.000
to think, live,

123
00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:48.916
and believe exactly what you believe too?

124
00:06:48.916 --> 00:06:51.125
I,

125
00:06:51.125 --> 00:06:55.250
Even I, being the creator of this world,

126
00:06:55.250 --> 00:06:59.541
do not hold this expectation of My devotees.

127
00:06:59.541 --> 00:07:03.541
I show every person a path to reach Me

128
00:07:03.541 --> 00:07:06.625
according to their own circumstances.

129
00:07:06.625 --> 00:07:08.875
Someone connects through devotion,

130
00:07:08.875 --> 00:07:13.000
someone through abhyasa yoga,
someone through selfless action,

131
00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:18.583
And someone may not yet even be attracted.

132
00:07:18.583 --> 00:07:20.041
But

133
00:07:20.041 --> 00:07:24.833
in My boundless love, there is space for all.

134
00:07:24.833 --> 00:07:30.875
Can you do the same in your family too?

135
00:07:30.875 --> 00:07:33.833
Can you respect different thinking,

136
00:07:33.833 --> 00:07:39.750
different ideas, and different perspectives?

137
00:07:39.750 --> 00:07:45.166
Not everyone will see life through the same lens.

138
00:07:45.166 --> 00:07:47.541
This is natural.

139
00:07:47.541 --> 00:07:49.041
A family

140
00:07:49.041 --> 00:07:52.375
is not built from identical views,

141
00:07:52.375 --> 00:07:56.000
but it is certainly built from

142
00:07:56.000 --> 00:08:00.250
love, understanding, and
respect for one another.

143
00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:04.541
Let them walk their own path.

144
00:08:04.541 --> 00:08:08.250
Hold their hand, offer this guidance,

145
00:08:08.250 --> 00:08:11.375
and do not hold this attachment

146
00:08:11.375 --> 00:08:14.458
that they only the path you have

147
00:08:14.458 --> 00:08:18.375
shown should walk.

148
00:08:18.375 --> 00:08:19.875
Love

149
00:08:19.875 --> 00:08:23.166
lies not in changing someone,

150
00:08:23.166 --> 00:08:27.291
but in accepting them.

151
00:08:27.291 --> 00:08:28.958
Just as I

152
00:08:28.958 --> 00:08:34.333
accept you completely,

153
00:08:34.333 --> 00:08:35.666
in the same way

154
00:08:35.666 --> 00:08:39.541
you too will accept others

155
00:08:39.541 --> 00:08:42.666
and love them.

156
00:08:47.541 --> 00:08:52.291
Whatever your current spiritual level may be,

157
00:08:52.291 --> 00:08:57.041
I do not judge you by that.

158
00:08:57.041 --> 00:09:02.458
I see the possibilities of spiritual
progress hidden within you.

159
00:09:02.458 --> 00:09:04.125
I am showing every person

160
00:09:04.125 --> 00:09:07.166
a path of spiritual progress

161
00:09:07.166 --> 00:09:11.458
according to their present circumstances.

162
00:09:11.458 --> 00:09:13.125
Think,

163
00:09:13.125 --> 00:09:15.208
in professional life,

164
00:09:15.208 --> 00:09:18.833
leadership too is much the same.

165
00:09:18.833 --> 00:09:22.166
Good leaders do not judge people

166
00:09:22.166 --> 00:09:27.166
by their current situation.

167
00:09:27.166 --> 00:09:32.041
but they recognise the hidden
abilities within them

168
00:09:32.041 --> 00:09:34.500
and gradually

169
00:09:34.500 --> 00:09:37.083
lead them toward growth.

170
00:09:37.083 --> 00:09:42.041
At your workplace, not everyone
will be the same.

171
00:09:42.041 --> 00:09:46.083
Some have dedication, but less skill.

172
00:09:46.083 --> 00:09:50.458
Someone is putting in effort,
but needs guidance,

173
00:09:50.458 --> 00:09:55.791
And some are already moving forward
with dedication and confidence.

174
00:09:55.791 --> 00:09:58.333
The work of a senior

175
00:09:58.333 --> 00:10:01.916
is not to fit everyone into the same mould,

176
00:10:01.916 --> 00:10:05.541
but to create such an environment

177
00:10:05.541 --> 00:10:10.000
where everyone can grow at their own pace.

178
00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:12.291
Where there is a lack of skill,

179
00:10:12.291 --> 00:10:15.583
there help through training.

180
00:10:15.583 --> 00:10:19.500
Where there is a lack of dedication,
awaken enthusiasm.

181
00:10:19.500 --> 00:10:22.750
Where both skill and dedication exist,

182
00:10:22.750 --> 00:10:25.166
there give encouragement.

183
00:10:25.166 --> 00:10:28.291
Comparisons between people

184
00:10:28.291 --> 00:10:33.083
and negative comments do not build trust.

185
00:10:33.083 --> 00:10:34.916
Trust is built.

186
00:10:34.916 --> 00:10:37.750
Through sensitive leadership.

187
00:10:37.750 --> 00:10:39.000
When leadership

188
00:10:39.000 --> 00:10:42.625
comes with sensitivity and compassion,

189
00:10:42.625 --> 00:10:46.041
people trust you.

190
00:10:46.041 --> 00:10:51.208
And that trust is the key
to meaningful leadership.
